Package: asys-images
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Roman <roman@nekko.ai>
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Depends: docker.io | docker-ce, docker-buildx | docker-buildx-plugin, zstd
Homepage: https://github.com/glguida/asys
Description: container images and release record for asys @UPSTREAM@
 The images of asys build @BUILD@ (asys-runtime, asys-workers, asys-worlds,
 asys-bpmn, asys-human-interface, asys-env-default), loaded into the local
 Docker Engine on installation (or later with asys-images-load), and the
 release.json that the asys commands use to find them. Old image IDs stay
 in use by running work; "asys-images-load --prune" removes unreferenced ones.
